    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests that {@link LocalDate#until(java.time.chrono.ChronoLocalDate)} reports a zero ISO {@link Period} when the target {@link PaxDate} refers to the very same day. <p>Each test case below pairs a {@code PaxDate} with the {@code LocalDate} that denotes the identical calendar day. Because the two represent the same instant in time, the ISO period from the {@code LocalDate} up to the {@code PaxDate} must be exactly {@link Period#ZERO}."
   },
